# Allow only image inputs into the build context. Keep credentials, datasets,
# local Windows .venv, caches, Git history, and test artifacts out of the image.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!src/**

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
